@startuml
actor user
participant authenticator
participant client
participant verifier

user -> client : visit website
client -> verifier : visit website
verifier --> client : credential request
client -> authenticator : QR code
authenticator --> client : fresh per-session BLE advert (nonce)
client <-> authenticator : mount CTAP data transfer channel
authenticator -> client : authenticator identifier AID\n(inside the encrypted channel only)
client -> client : select the private key enrolled under AID\nfrom the protected key store
client -> client : generate COSE_Sign1 assertion\n(handshake transcript hash + timestamp)
client -> authenticator : COSE_Sign1 assertion
authenticator -> authenticator : verify COSE_Sign1 against the key enrolled\nfor this client (client authentication)
authenticator -> authenticator : check timestamp not expired (replay window)
authenticator -> authenticator : check hash in COSE = this session's\nNoise handshake-transcript hash (not replayable)
authenticator -> user : ask for consent
user --> authenticator : consent
authenticator --> client : credential
@enduml
